ult. } 3... Ke3 4. Kg2 4... Ke2 5. Kg3 5... Kf1 { The result has changed. The h column was the only route to distant opposition. [%cal Re2f1] }) (3. Kg1 { The g1 square is tempting, but the result changes there. } 3... Kc3 4. Kg2 4... Kc2 5. Kg3 5... Kd1 { Off the h column, your king loses the opposition, and the result has changed. [%cal Rc2d1] }) (3. Kh1 { Your king's route through h1 changes the result. } 3... Kc3 4. Kg2 4... Kc2 5. Kg3 5... Kd1 { The result changes the moment you step away from the h column. [%cal Rc2d1] }) (3. Kg2 { This time g2 is the wrong square. The result changes. } 3... Ke2 4. Kg3 4... Kd1 5. Kf2 5... Kd2 { This square costs you the h column, and the result has changed. [%cal Rd1d2] }) 1-0


